9interpr\u00e9tation po\u00e9tique du r\u00e9pertoire proven\u00e7al. A l\u2019antique fr\u00e9quentation du Bengale par les n\u00e9gociants marseillais se substituent aujourd\u2019hui l\u2019entretien spirituel et l\u2019extase po\u00e9tique. O\u00f9, par le texte, le r\u00e9cit et la musique, quatre utopistes parviennent \u00e0 transcender l\u2019enthousiasme de cette premi\u00e8re rencontre.","og_url":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-adherent\/concert-du-duo-lavoa-lapo-au-theatre-de-la-colline-avec-rahul-ananda-et-salvio-la-rocca\/","og_site_name":"LMELB","article_published_time":"2025-04-04T11:03:16+00:00","author":"cielamparo@gmail.com","twitter_card":"summary_large_image","twitter_misc":{"\u00c9crit par":"cielamparo@gmail.com","Dur\u00e9e de lecture estim\u00e9e":"1 minute"},"schema":{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"Article","@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-adherent\/concert-du-duo-lavoa-lapo-au-theatre-de-la-colline-avec-rahul-ananda-et-salvio-la-rocca\/#article","isPartOf":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-adherent\/concert-du-duo-lavoa-lapo-au-theatre-de-la-colline-avec-rahul-ananda-et-salvio-la-rocca\/"},"author":{"name":"cielamparo@gmail.com","@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/#\/schema\/person\/a20fce030af5627246c5cc6cd59986c0"},"headline":"Concert du Du\u00f2 Lavo\u00e0 Lap\u00f2 au Th\u00e9\u00e2tre de la Colline avec Rahul Ananda et Salvio La Rocca","datePublished":"2025-04-04T11:03:16+00:00","mainEntityOfPage":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-adherent\/concert-du-duo-lavoa-lapo-au-theatre-de-la-colline-avec-rahul-ananda-et-salvio-la-rocca\/"},"wordCount":318,"publisher":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/#organization"},"image":{"@id":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/actualite-adherent\/concert-du-duo-lavoa-lapo-au-theatre-de-la-colline-avec-rahul-ananda-et-salvio-la-rocca\/#primaryimage"},"thumbnailUrl":"https:\/\/www.famdt.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/04\/regards-sur-bangladesh.jpg","keywords":["Concert \